      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "No pushy sales operators here - two options (standard and premium) were offered electronically as per expected timeframe. One phone call and I had all the info I needed to make a decision. James clearly knows his stuff and operates an effective and efficient business. His installation crew turned up on time, gave me an estimate of time to complete the job on the day, did a quality install and left the site tidy after having provided a run-down on how the system works. We literally had to do nothing more than select our preferred option and James’ team did everything else. The Solar Analytics app that was provided with the system is an absolute eye-opener in regard to understanding and managing household energy use. The only negative - and a minor one at that - was associated with the Green Loan finance for the system (nothing to do with Barra Electrical). While the finance broker (Parker Lane) did an excellent job in teeing up a great finance option,  the amount of detail required to support the application seemed almost comical given the size of the proposed loan.",
